msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/superposition-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/8648c4b8-edd1-4e40-9c74-50219c84c928-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/superposition-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/8648c4b8-edd1-4e40-9c74-50219c84c928-0.avif)\n"

