#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Discussion questions: {#discussion-questions}"
msgstr "Pertanyaan diskusi: {#discussion-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why can the state of a qubit be visualized on the Bloch sphere, but the probability distribution of a coin flip cannot?\n"
msgstr "Mengapa keadaan qubit bisa divisualisasikan di bola Bloch, sedangkan distribusi probabilitas lemparan koin tidak bisa?\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why is a coin flipping in the air not the best analogy to a quantum superposition state? What aspect of superpositions are not captured in this analogy?\n"
msgstr "Mengapa koin yang melayang di udara bukan analogi terbaik untuk keadaan superposisi kuantum? Aspek superposisi apa yang tidak tertangkap dalam analogi ini?\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Challenge problems: {#challenge-problems}"
msgstr "Soal tantangan: {#challenge-problems}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Qiskit to create a circuit that transforms the state $|0\\rangle$ to the state $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}|0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{2}e^{i \\frac{5\\pi}{6}}|1\\rangle$\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Qiskit untuk membuat Circuit yang mengubah keadaan $|0\\rangle$ ke keadaan $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}|0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{2}e^{i \\frac{5\\pi}{6}}|1\\rangle$\n"
